    "closed": false,
    "dateLastActivity": "2026-11-03T09:35:58.161Z",
    "desc": "## Lore:\n\n# **“I’ll be the judge!”**\n\n**The Stand of Jotaro Kujo. One of the most powerful Close-Range Stands, it possesses superhuman senses, strength, and speed. Its overwhelming power is capable of destroying diamonds, and it eventually awakens the ability to stop time.**\n\n---\n\n![image.webp](https://trello.com/1/cards/6ab432a7415e48dc2254a026/attachments/6ab577a90b43bbba5b5ece02/previews/6ab577ab0b43bbba5b5ed059/download/image.webp)\n\n## Pose:\n\n![image.webp](https://trello.com/1/cards/6ab432a7415e48dc2254a026/attachments/6ae11dba5e08ceaf1fd3e47c/previews/6ae11dbc5e08ceaf1fd3e6a4/download/image.webp)\n\n---\n\n## M1 Light Combo & M2 Attack\n\n![SPM1.gif](https://trello.com/1/cards/6ab432a7415e48dc2254a026/attachments/6ab57afd9fa8f138666b01e9/previews/6ab57b099fa8f138666b228a/download/SPM1.gif)\n\n## Barrage / Rage Finish [HOLD]\n\n**Unleash a rapid flurry of punches on your opponent.**\n\n**Base cooldown: 23s**\n\n![barragesp.gif](https://trello.com/1/cards/6ab432a7415e48dc2254a026/attachments/6ab57835ebc0130e7a2d948e/previews/6ab5783febc0130e7a2dabdd/download/barragesp.gif)\n\n## Rage Finish (HOLD)\n\n![rage.gif](https://trello.com/1/cards/6ab432a7415e48dc2254a026/attachments/6ac0dd0bc459d816d43b16cc/previews/6ac0dd23c459d816d43b3556/download/rage.gif)\n\n## Star Finger\n\n**Extend Star Platinum’s finger to strike from mid-range.**\n\n**Base cooldown: 35s**\n\n![fingers.gif](https://trello.com/1/cards/6ab432a7415e48dc2254a026/attachments/6ae92c78489e8a6c76c66ac1/previews/6ae92c7a489e8a6c76c6738d/download/fingers.gif)\n\n# Tap:\n\n![image.webp](https://trello.com/1/cards/6ab432a7415e48dc2254a026/attachments/6ae92bd3848c02a9449bdb57/previews/6ae92bd3848c02a9449bde75/download/image.webp)\n\n## Hold:\n\n![image.webp](https://trello.com/1/cards/6ab432a7415e48dc2254a026/attachments/6ae92be56cb4ecae144a17e7/previews/6ae92be66cb4ecae144a19ab/download/image.webp)\n\n## Ora Smash\n\n**Wind up a heavy ORA punch that sends enemies flying. (Can be held to extend its range.)**\n\n**Base cooldown: 32s**\n\n![smash.gif](https://trello.com/1/cards/6ab432a7415e48dc2254a026/attachments/6ac0ddd68cc063bcc61d6efa/previews/6ac0dde28cc063bcc61d78a9/download/smash.gif)\n\n## Held Variant:\n\n![holdsmash.gif](https://trello.com/1/cards/6ab432a7415e48dc2254a026/attachments/6ac0de03787883a59138b5f9/previews/6ac0de0a787883a59138bdfb/download/holdsmash.gif)\n\n## Inhale\n\n**Hold to draw enemies, loose objects and cars toward Star Platinum. The pull stuns without dealing damage, grounds flying enemies, and shakes ripe fruit from trees.**\n\n![inhaleee.gif](https://trello.com/1/cards/6ab432a7415e48dc2254a026/attachments/6aba8d49130bd5e97968c468/previews/6aba8d4d130bd5e97968c997/download/inhaleee.gif)\n\n## Pulling Objects:\n\n![carpull.gif](https://trello.com/1/cards/6ab432a7415e48dc2254a026/attachments/6aba8e379693b44d4d90a294/previews/6aba8e3a9693b44d4d90a5e3/download/carpull.gif)\n\n## Pilot Mode\n\n![sppilot.gif](https://trello.com/1/cards/6ab432a7415e48dc2254a026/attachments/6ab57b59bda899e4cc2a0c86/previews/6ab57b5fbda899e4cc2a172a/download/sppilot.gif)\n\n## **Platinum Parry**\n\n**Hold F. Press M1 to try to catch a projectile, or R/M2 to deflect it.**\n\n## R/M2 (Deflect):\n\n![deflects.gif](https://trello.com/1/cards/6ab432a7415e48dc2254a026/attachments/6ab975f66e13cc0d65fe8862/previews/6ab975f96e13cc0d65fe8cbd/download/deflects.gif)\n\n‌\n\n## M1 (Catch):\n\n![catchhh.gif](https://trello.com/1/cards/6ab432a7415e48dc2254a026/attachments/6ab976523abe76a6c8096860/previews/6ab976563abe76a6c8096f2f/download/catchhh.gif)\n\n**(Caught and thrown)**\n\n---\n\n# EX [Awakening Moves]\n\n## Stand Jump [1 Bar]\n\n**Use your Stand’s power to launch high into the air.**\n\n**Base cooldown: 2s**\n\n![standupm.gif](https://trello.com/1/cards/6ab432a7415e48dc2254a026/attachments/6ab57ab51e725c982512a9e9/previews/6ab57abf1e725c982512bd14/download/standupm.gif)\n\n## Time Stop In-Air Variant:\n\n![standjumps.gif](https://trello.com/1/cards/6ab432a7415e48dc2254a026/attachments/6ab6897d245b3d5985289178/previews/6ab68983245b3d598528990f/download/standjumps.gif)\n\n‌\n\n## Tandem Flank [2 Bars]\n\n**You and your stand attack from both sides.**\n\n**Base cooldown: 45s**\n\n![tandem.gif](https://trello.com/1/cards/6ab432a7415e48dc2254a026/attachments/6ab57a8eb028012768987b45/previews/6ab57a97b0280127689889a1/download/tandem.gif)\n\n## Time Stop / Quick Time Stop [HOLD]\n\n**Freeze time. Higher ability makes it last longer; 100 Ability doubles the base duration. (CAN BE OVERWRITEN BY OTHER TIME STOP STANDS.)**\n\n**Base cooldown: 20s**\n\n![timestop.gif](https://trello.com/1/cards/6ab432a7415e48dc2254a026/attachments/6ab579fc13654161b26851ca/previews/6ab57a0b13654161b2687174/download/timestop.gif)\n\n## Overwriting Time Stop:\n\n![overwrite.gif](https://trello.com/1/cards/6ab432a7415e48dc2254a026/attachments/6ab7f29cde141be0163494ae/previews/6ab7f2b2de141be01634c68f/download/overwrite.gif)\n\n## Quick Time Stop (Held)\n\n**Using Quick Time Stop cuts half your original timestop duration in exchange for no startup**.\n\n![quickts.gif](https://trello.com/1/cards/6ab432a7415e48dc2254a026/attachments/6ab7f4a0a021322277f1cf76/previews/6ab7f4aaa021322277f1d798/download/quickts.gif)",
